# Files that must never be read into a session or included in an export to
# bob_sessions/. See bob_sessions/README.md.
#
# The live credentials are not in this repo at all. They live outside the
# working directory, at ~/.prelude/.env by default or wherever
# PRELUDE_ENV_FILE points, so no search over the repo can reach them.
# Never open, print or edit that file; use .env.example for the variable
# names.
#
# The entry below stays as a second layer, in case a .env is ever created
# at the repo root by habit.
.env
